WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.720
My earliest memory as a child . . . I can remember . . . my mom let me pick out my own clothes.

2
00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:10.340
When I was little, really young.

3
00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:21.060
She gave me a pair of pants that had stripes, vertical stripes . . . and I had a shirt that had horizontal stripes.

4
00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:24.860
I always wanted to wear them together.

5
00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:32.300
That was my favorite thing, and I guess that’s a fashion faux pas, but I thought it was so fresh the way,

6
00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:35.320
like . . . I don’t know . . . the stripes would go against each other.
